lign="top" charoff="50">OS-11A</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.5</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">4.9&#x000b1;1.2</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">OS-12</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">13</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">F</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">High grade OS</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">9.8</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">4.4&#x000b1;0.7</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">OS-12A</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">7.6</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">4.2&#x000b1;0.8</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">OS-16</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">15</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">F</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">High grade OS</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">5.3</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1.4&#x000b1;0.5</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote3"><label>a</label><p>Functional p53 status was determined by measuring relative luciferase expression after PG13-Luc transfection compared to MG15-Luc transfection. Scores: ratio 0.5&#x02013;2.0, deficient; ratio 2&#x02013;10, heterogeneous; and ratio&#x0003e;10, functional.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote4"><label/><p>OS=osteosarcoma.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap id="tbl3" position="float"><label>Table 3</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Ad5-&#x00394;24RGD viral replication in doxorubicin-treated OS cells as determined by quantitative PCR analysis</